  1475	# =============================================================================
  1476	# PLAN-167 — _ownership_verdict: THE ownership decision.
  1477	#
  1478	# install.sh and upgrade.sh stop deciding and start executing. Every defect in
  1479	# the 35-finding S296 review series was a cell of this space whose answer was
  1480	# decided branch-locally, so two branches could disagree about the same
  1481	# question and nothing detected it.
  1482	#
  1483	#   $1 surface        spec | protocol | marker
  1484	#   $2 prior_record   none | hash | link_match | link_retargeted
  1485	#   $3 live_type      absent | dir | dir_empty | regular | symlink | special
  1486	#                     | ancestor_symlink
  1487	#   $4 live_content   pristine | legacy_pristine | legacy_pristine_partial
  1488	#                     | edited | -
  1489	#   $5 source_has     yes | no
  1490	#   $6 mode           copy | link
  1491	#   $7 ceremony       user | maintainer
  1492	#   $8 operation      install_fresh | install_rerun | upgrade
  1493	#   $9 skip_requested none | self | descendant
  1494	#
  1495	#   stdout: "<VERDICT> <HASH_SOURCE>", rc 0
  1496	#   rc 1, no output: a combination the legality rules forbid.
  1497	#
  1498	# PURE: no filesystem, no globals, no environment. Callers observe the nine
  1499	# dimensions and pass them in. That purity is what lets the same table drive a
  1500	# millisecond unit oracle as well as the ~25-minute end-to-end suite; S296 had
  1501	# only the slow instrument, at one cell per ~40-minute round.
  1502	#
  1503	# ABORT_SURFACE is deliberately NOT produced here (round-1 consensus C2). A
  1504	# failed backup is not a property of these nine dimensions — it is the CALLER
  1505	# failing to carry out a verdict it was handed. And per INV-3 that failure
  1506	# NEVER advances the record: recording a delivery that did not happen is the
  1507	# over-claiming direction ADR-155-AMEND-1 §3 forbids.
  1508	#
  1509	# Contract: docs/ownership-decision-table.md · Truth: scripts/tests/ownership_table.tsv
  1510	# =============================================================================

