   138	>    installer does not validate the value: a part carrying `..` or `/`
   139	>    resolves to a path OUTSIDE the target and is written there, and the
   140	>    manifest records it (signed condition 73).
   141	> 2. **The placeholder pass rewrites files of yours.** After reporting a
   142	>    pre-existing file as `EXISTS (skipping)`, the installer still
   143	>    runs its `{{PLACEHOLDER}}` substitution over a FIXED set and replaces
