   167	    # bytes). Same delivery-record condition as PROTOCOL.md/SPEC above:
   168	    # never file presence. An EXISTS-skipped adopter-customized schema in
   169	    # the manifest would record the ADOPTER's bytes as framework-owned, and
   170	    # a later uninstall would see the matching hash and DELETE it (t8 P1).
