  1341	  # instead of FMS_ROOT. The ENUMERATION still walks FMS_ROOT (what the target
  1342	  # holds), but the recorded baseline must be what the framework SHIPS — never
  1343	  # an adopter-customized target file. Without this, upgrade.sh's post-upgrade
  1344	  # rewrite (C.7) records hash(customized-but-preserved file) as the baseline,
  1345	  # which the NEXT upgrade reads as H_dst==H_base => FRAMEWORK-CHANGED => clobber
